Error [E0308]: `Dev.reload` takes `.Restart` or `.Hot`
  --> dev_context_methods.jet:4:14
    |
  4 |     d.reload(.Fast)
    |              ^
 Why: The reload mode is one of the two dev loop behaviours
 Fix: Write `d.reload(.Restart)` or `d.reload(.Hot)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0308

Error [E0108]: This needs String, but the value is Int
  --> dev_context_methods.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     d.watch(1)
    |             ^
 Why: The value here does not have the type required by this declaration
 Fix: Use a value of the required type or convert it explicitly
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108

Error [E0764]: `Dev.serve` takes its port positionally or as `port:`
  --> dev_context_methods.jet:6:13
    |
  6 |     d.serve(host: 3)
    |             ^^^^
 Why: The dev server argument is the port
 Fix: Write `d.serve(3000)` or `d.serve(port: 3000)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0764

Error [E0311]: `open` isn't a method of `Dev`
  --> dev_context_methods.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     d.open()
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: The dev context offers `watch`, `serve` and `reload`
 Fix: Use `d.watch(path)`, `d.serve(port)` or `d.reload(.Restart)` / `d.reload(.Hot)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
